# This repository is published to the public web. Anything committed here
# is world-readable the moment it lands on main, so key material must never
# be stageable by accident - an SSH private key was written into this folder
# once already, by an ssh-keygen that took a filename from the wrong prompt.

# --- key and credential material -------------------------------------
id_*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.ppk
*_rsa
*_dsa
*_ecdsa
*_ed25519
.env
.env.*
*.credentials
# ssh-keygen writing to a stray filename produces a matching .pub beside it;
# catch the pair rather than only the half that looks dangerous.
*.pub

# --- macOS and editor litter -----------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- local scratch ----------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
*.log
